export anchor SoftPremiumStyle:
    number: 192
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Soft premium
    idea: A quiet, high-end workspace on pale lavender grey, where floating 16px cards with faint gradients and soft shadows, a serif for headings and generous spacing make the dashboard feel calm and considered.
    base: light
    palette:
        mist: #f2f1f7, the page, a pale lavender grey
        pearl: #ffffff, cards, the rail and fields, fading to #faf9fe at the bottom
        aubergine: #221f33, headings and body text
        heather: #5a5670, meta, labels, eyebrows and axis text
        veil: #e4e1ee, 1px card edges, ring tracks and dividers, never text
        iris: #4f3ca8, the primary button gradient, current nav text, rings, links, this week's bars and focus
        lilac: #ece8fa, the hero gradient start, current nav fill, KPI icon circles and last week's bars
        blush: #f8f0f3, the hero gradient end and the overdue icon circle
        jade: #1e6a4e, On track with a solid circle and check on a pale green pill
        bronze: #874a0e, At risk with a solid triangle and bar on a pale amber pill
        garnet: #a3263d, Behind and overdue, with a solid square and cross on a pale rose pill
    type:
        Two stacks. Headings and figures use Iowan Old Style, Palatino
        Linotype, Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia, serif at weight 500.
        Text uses Avenir Next, Avenir, Segoe UI, Helvetica Neue, system-ui,
        sans-serif. The greeting is 40px serif, KPI figures 32px serif,
        card titles 24px serif, project names 17px sans semibold, body
        15px at 1.6, and eyebrows 12px semibold caps tracked 0.12em.
    layout:
        A floating white rail 248px wide, inset 16px with 16px corners,
        holds a gradient rounded mark with the serif brand, six icon and
        label nav items with Home in a lilac pill, and a user tile at the
        bottom with Mara Okafor. The main column opens with a white pill
        search, then a round bell and a gradient pill New project button at
        the right. A wide hero card with a lilac to blush gradient puts the
        caps date, the serif greeting and a white overdue pill with a
        square symbol and Review link at left, and four translucent white
        KPI tiles in a 2 by 2 grid at right, each with an icon in a lilac
        circle, a serif figure and a label, the overdue tile white with a
        garnet figure. Projects follow as six cards in three columns, each
        with a progress ring holding the percent, a caps team eyebrow and
        the name, three facts for tasks, due date and days left, and a
        status pill. The last row splits 3 to 2, a chart card with rounded
        bars for both weeks, last week lilac and this week an iris
        gradient, and three serif totals below, beside an activity card
        with gradient initial discs. Below 1180px project cards go two
        across and the hero stacks. Below 860px the rail becomes a top card
        with nav in a 3 by 2 grid. On phones cards go one across and the
        chart scrolls inside its card.
    spacing: An 8px unit, generous. 24 to 36px card padding, 24px gaps, 40px between rows.
    density: Low. Six project cards, each with three facts.
    corners: 16px cards and rail, 12px tiles, nav items and fields, pills for buttons, search and status chips.
    borders: A 1px veil edge on every card so it holds its shape on mist.
    shadows: Soft and layered, 0 1px 2px at 4 percent ink plus 0 12px 32px at 8 percent iris. The primary button has its own iris glow.
    icons: 1.5px line icons at 18px, KPI icons inside 40px lilac circles. Status uses solid shapes with a white glyph.
    focus: A 1px iris edge inside a 3px iris ring at 35 percent opacity, following the control's corners.
    tone: Gracious and calm, such as Good to see you, Mara.
